REAL-USE

This appears to be a real production pipeline scoring an actual agent run, evidenced by the detailed monitoring note showing a genuine incident with quantified damage (1,900 orders lost over 3 hours), a tracking number (INC-2291), and timeline markers indicating when the problem was discovered and resolved.

